###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - The text gives the control/trainset pair as '14/18 to 8/10 (RMSE (control set)/RMSE(trainset))', but also states the direct HDNNP control-set error as 18 meV/atom; the encoding follows the explicit 18 meV/atom (control 18, train 14; Delta1 control 10, train 8).
# - Approximate values ('around 23', 'about 28.2'), force errors from error distributions (0.96 and 0.47 eV/A, metric not named), Pt25/Pt55 absolute and relative errors, Chebyshev and architecture scans, the Delta2 scheme and CPU timings are not encoded.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/sun2019.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

